# Reins of the Pack Kodo from Okamache at the Durotar Supply and Logistics camp.
# The reins cost 6,000 Merchant's Favor, earned from crate hand-ins at the camps.
# Sources: NPC 256400 (position); Forever
# client 1.60.1.70338 via wago.tools (ItemSparse 262766: level 60, Journeyman
# Riding). Merchant's Favor is a currency Polestar cannot count.

step Durotar Supply and Logistics
  tip The camp is just outside the Crossroads in the Barrens. Loot supply crates in the world, fill them, and hand them in at the camp for Merchant's Favor (5-20 a crate); the Pack Kodo costs 6,000. Craftsman's Writs may help from level 10.
  goto 49.5,29.0 "Durotar Supply and Logistics camp"

step Pack Kodo
  tip The reins need level 60 and Journeyman Riding to ride (Forever client); you can buy them earlier. By beta reports Okamache sells them only once you are Exalted with Durotar Supply and Logistics: crates pay only Favor, so follow the Supply Factions Reputation guide (Craftsman's Writs and the Shipping Label pay the reputation).
  vendor 256400 "Okamache" @49.6,28.8
  buy 262766 "Reins of the Pack Kodo" npc 256400 -- 6,000 Merchant's Favor
